    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs; land_basis=terrestrial_forest): Heading is explicitly a dyewood (fustic, Brazil wood, sapan, Nicaragua wood, red/Guinea wood, braziletto); filed with Dye Woods Logwood (htc:0096) rather than building timber. Layer-1 observations: 67 rows, 1800–1869. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×61; KEW_CUST 5 ×3; KEW_CUST 4 ×3. Units: Tons ×64; Tons.Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×3. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×11; Other Parts → United Kingdom ×9; Mexico → United Kingdom ×9; Brazil → United Kingdom ×7."@en ;
